step Expert Tailoring
  zone Azeroth
  tip Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225; it needs Tailoring 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Georgio Bolero (Stormwind City) and Timothy Worthington (Dustwallow Marsh); Horde Daryl Stack (Hillsbrad Foothills) and Josef Gregorian (Undercity). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: Bolt of Mageweave (from 140). 150-225 takes about 15s of recipes and 21g 16s of vendor goods, plus 264 Silk Cloth and 900 Mageweave Cloth to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach Black Mageweave Vest (from 170) and Black Mageweave Headband (from 190), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3.
