step Runecloth Belt to 234
  zone Azeroth
  tip Runecloth Belt is yellow at 225 (yellow 225, green 240, grey 255): about 11 crafts to 234. Each takes 3 Bolt of Runecloth and 1 Rune Thread. Make the 33 Bolt of Runecloth first. Rune Thread from tailoring vendors.
